# Goga Stainless Email Configuration
# ---------------------------------------------
# Instructions for Gmail:
# 1. Sign in to your Goga Stainless Gmail account (e.g. info.gogastainless@gmail.com).
# 2. Go to Google Account > Security > 2-Step Verification (turn on if not enabled).
# 3. Search for "App passwords" (or go to: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords).
# 4. Create a new app password named "Goga Website" and copy the 16-character code.
# 5. Paste the email and 16-character code below:

SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=465
SMTP_SECURE=true
SMTP_USER=info.gogastainless@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=your-16-char-app-password
SMTP_FROM="Goga Stainless" <info.gogastainless@gmail.com>

# Business inboxes to receive enquiries
BUSINESS_EMAIL=info.gogastainless@gmail.com
BUSINESS_CC_EMAIL=gogastainless@gmail.com
